- Loads `./styles.css` and `./ui/main.js` as a module

**`web/styles.css`** — dark laboratory theme:
- Near-black blue-grey (`#0b0e11`) background, slightly lighter panel surfaces
- Monospace throughout, no external fonts
- `evidence-cell` class: fluorescent green fill (`rgba(61,255,115,0.18)`) + green text
- `evidence-row td`: dashed fluorescent green outline
- `state-answer` card: dashed green left border; `state-abstain` card: amber left border
- Responsive: stacks vertically below 800 px

**`src/ui/main.ts`** — all behaviour for U2:
- Parses the ledger once at load, writes row/column counts to header readouts
- Builds the full 48-row grid with `data-row-index` and `data-col` attributes on each cell for precise targeting
- `clearHighlight` / `applyHighlight` functions add/remove `evidence-cell` and `evidence-row` classes; first evidence row is scrolled into view
- `renderAnswerCard` calls `answerQuestion` verbatim, renders ANSWER (status label + answer text + `[Row n · col]` chips) or ABSTAIN (`기록에 없음` in amber), then applies/clears the grid highlight
